# E2E test naming (Playwright)

For new or renamed specs, follow the **project suite README** (umbraculum-dev: `apps/web/e2e/README.md`) as source of truth.

When the project does not prescribe a scheme, prefer:

- Kebab-case descriptive filenames under the suite root (e.g. `smoke/login-and-dashboard.spec.ts`, `smoke/mrp-crp-export-alpha.spec.ts`).
- Stable action-oriented names; avoid embedding environment-specific hosts or secrets in filenames.

Do not invent filename schemes that the project's E2E docs do not use.
